  "description": "The next day's stage of your cycle tour is coming up - and it's going to be tough. But you know you can always rely on the sporty support of the Cross Lite SX 1. Our versatile and particularly lightweight e-trekking bike offers a natural riding experience and shines with additional power exactly when you need it. Thanks to the Light Assist concept and the Bosch Performance Line SX drive, the Cross Lite SX 1 combines dynamism with agility and is therefore an absolute mobiliser in everyday life, making the car fade more and more into the background on short and medium distances. The comprehensive equipment with the MonkeyLink 2.0 interface, MonkeyLoad pannier rack and additional brake light also play their part.",
